    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、大丈夫なのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "世間の反応を確認するのは大事でしょ\r\n悪口ばかりで気が滅入ることもあるけど、今回は違うの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ほら、『久しぶりに見た有馬かな、やっぱり可愛い』だって\r\n私の魅力をわかってる人もちゃんといるのね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410030"
  },
  {
    "select": "いないほうが\r\nおかしいくらいだよ",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001411"
  },
  {
    "select": "ファンがいるのは\r\n知ってるだろ？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001412"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "昔からのファン\r\nみたいだな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001413"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410040,
    "label": "1802001001411",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "たしかに私だって\r\n容姿には少しくらい自信があるけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "肯定してくれるファンがいるなんて思ってなかったから\r\nなんだか照れくさいわね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410060,
    "label": "1802001001412",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "昔はね。でも今は箱推しのついでとか\r\nイベントでの盛り上がりでっていう人も多いじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "目の前で褒めてても裏で陰口叩く人もいるから\r\n純粋に褒めてくれる人がいるのは、嬉しいのよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410080,
    "label": "1802001001413",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうね、『久しぶり』って書いてるし\r\n私の子役時代を知ってるんだと思うわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001410090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "まあ私、細々と業界に居続けてたから、\r\n久しぶりじゃないんだけどね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100141/1802001001410090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
